<script lang="ts">import {onMount} from 'svelte';import {get} from '$lib/api';let rows:any[]=$state([]),error=$state('');onMount(async()=>{try{rows=await get('/api/audit?limit=500')}catch(e:any){error=e.message}});</script>
<div class="page-head"><div><span class="kicker">Reproducibility</span><h1>Audit trail</h1><p>Append-only change history for creation, updates, batch imports and migration events. Entity snapshots are separately versioned in the research database.</p></div><span class="status">Append-only</span></div>
{#if error}<div class="error">{error}</div>{/if}<div class="card"><div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>Time</th><th>Action</th><th>Entity</th><th>Actor</th><th>Source</th><th>Batch</th></tr></thead><tbody>{#each rows as r}<tr><td>{r.created_at}</td><td><b>{r.action}</b></td><td>{r.entity_type}<br/><span class="mono">{r.entity_uid||'—'}</span></td><td>{r.actor}</td><td><span class="tag">{r.source}</span></td><td class="mono">{r.import_batch_uid||'—'}</td></tr>{/each}</tbody></table>{#if !rows.length}<div class="empty">No audit events loaded.</div>{/if}</div></div>

